Description: desktop remote control for Denon and Marantz receivers
 A Qt application for controlling Denon and Marantz network receivers over
 the local network. It holds one connection to the receiver, which carries
 both the commands it sends and the notifications the receiver emits on its
 own, so the window stays in step with changes made from the front panel,
 the infrared remote or the HEOS app.
 .
 It covers power, volume in decibels, mute and input selection for the main
 zone and zone 2, surround modes, Quick Select presets, bass, treble and
 subwoofer trim, dynamic range compression, Restorer, ECO mode and the sleep
 timer, along with cursor control for the on-screen setup menu.
 .
 Receivers are found on the local network by discovery. A tray icon offers
 power, standby and mute without opening the window, and the mouse wheel over
 it changes the volume.
